{"headword":"אָהֵב","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. love</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָהֵ֑ב</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:9\" href=\"/Genesis.27.9\">Gn 27:9</a> + 7times; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָהֵ֥ב</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:14\" href=\"/Genesis.27.14\">Gn 27:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָהַב</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:3\" href=\"/Genesis.37.3\">Gn 37:3</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲהֵֽבְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.16\">Dt 15:16</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָֽהֲבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:7\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.7\">Ct 1:7</a> +, etc.; impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶאֱהַב (־הָ֑ב)</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.12\">Pr 3:12</a> +; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵהָ֑ב</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.17\">Pr 8:17</a> (cf. Ew<sup>§ 192 d</sup> Ges<sup>§ 68.1</sup>); <span dir=\"rtl\">וָֽאֹהַ֖ב</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 1:2\" href=\"/Malachi.1.2\">Mal 1:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֹהֲבֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 11:1\" href=\"/Hosea.11.1\">Ho 11:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹהֲבֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 14:5\" href=\"/Hosea.14.5\">Ho 14:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֹהֲבֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:167\" href=\"/Psalms.119.167\">ψ 119:167</a>; 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּאֵהֲבוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.22\">Pr 1:22</a> (cf. Kö<sup>I p. 394</sup> Ges<sup>§ 63 R. 2</sup>); <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּאֱהָ֑בוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 8:17\" href=\"/Zechariah.8.17\">Zc 8:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּאֱהָבוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 4:3\" href=\"/Psalms.4.3\">ψ 4:3</a>; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱהַב־</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 3:1\" href=\"/Hosea.3.1\">Ho 3:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱהָבֶהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.6\">Pr 4:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶהֱבוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:24\" href=\"/Psalms.31.24\">